        """Handles the GET v2/<account>/<user> call for getting user information.
        Can only be called by an account .admin.
        On success, a JSON dict will be returned as described::
            {"groups": [
                {"name": "<act>:<usr>"},
                {"name": "<account>"},
                {"name": "<additional-group>"}
             ],
             "auth": "plaintext:<key>"
